{{Q contains questions and investigations that the user wants to poke later.
,{{Questions about minds, identity, and agency remain open.
,{An octopus with intelligence distributed among its arms raises the question of whether individual arms can behave selfishly toward one another.}
,{A pause in consciousness during dreamless sleep raises the question of whether continuity differs from teleportation, resurrection, or consciousness transfer.}
,{Awakening as a second instance of oneself raises the question of how that differs from awakening after dreamless sleep.}
,{The proposition that free will is largely an illusion caused by an inability to count or track causal detail remains explicitly uncertain.}
,{The question remains whether proving that something nonexistent exists could somehow cause it to exist.}
,{The dangers of allowing a computer to aid a person's thoughts through a cognitive orthosis remain unresolved.}
}}
,{{Questions about optics and perception remain open.
,{The relationship between field of view and focus remains to be investigated.}
,{The limiting claim that a 180-degree field of view makes a subject infinitely small remains unestablished.}
,{Whether dynamically changing a watch face would improve memory of the current time remains to be tested.}
,{Meditating while allowing mental imagery in only one color remains an experiential question.}
}}
,{{Questions about software conventions and information structures remain open.
,{The necessity of fixed positional argument ordering when all arguments have distinct types remains in question.}
,{The similarities between a Tree-UI, the PAE or ddth tool, and a Git-based approach remain to be explored.}
,{The possibility of a filename-entry tool that interprets convenient symbolic input without requiring normal escapes remains to be explored.}
,{The usefulness of representing STL-like container structures as operating-system directories under version control remains to be explored.}
,{The possibility of treating a collection of related projects as subprojects of a larger recursive project structure remains to be explored.}
}}
,{{Questions about hardware feasibility remain open.
,{Whether resin printing is accurate enough for Braille keyboard keys remains to be tested.}
,{Whether an ESP can conveniently serve as a Bluetooth dongle for earbuds remains to be revisited.}
,{Whether capacitors are practical as a battery replacement for the Hurricane2 bench blower remains to be researched.}
,{Whether a VHS-C camera interface resembles CSI signaling remains to be investigated.}
,{Whether an FPGA is suitable for generating numerals on a salvaged CRT viewfinder remains to be tested.}
,{Whether a monitor remote can be electrically or optically coupled before resorting to transistor-controlled physical buttons remains to be tested.}
,{Which Cheer-Wings controllers still work remains to be determined.}
,{Whether removing ManCave ceiling tiles would create useful additional storage remains an open practical question.}
}}
,{{Questions about speculative physics and cosmology remain open.
,{Whether four symmetrically positioned black holes could redirect or capture a star's light remains unresolved.}
,{Whether gravitational balance among four black holes around a star would cause light to be captured or merely bent remains unresolved.}
,{The ethical responsibility of installing black holes around a star remains an explicit question.}
,{The consequences of reality being both simulated and finite remain undeveloped.}
,{Whether multiversal travel could be equivalent to time travel across complete Big-Bang-to-Big-Crunch cycles remains speculative.}
}}
,{{Questions about communication and computation remain open.
,{Whether every possible branch of a conversation could be pre-encoded into quantum states to create an illusion of instantaneous communication remains speculative and physically unestablished.}
,{Whether a closed-loop acknowledgement mechanism should be added to the VHS QR-code communication experiment remains open.}
,{Whether USB signaling or a response image could supply a communications or baud check for the VHS experiment remains open.}
,{Whether a state-machine finder could automatically identify unfamiliar digital integrated circuits remains to be explored.}
}}
,{{Questions about biology and evolution remain open.
,{Whether pain and fear of losing oneself are among evolution's most universal psychological forces remains a hypothesis.}
,{Whether simulated worms could form a useful neural-network substrate remains to be explored.}
,{Whether noncoding DNA could theoretically carry an encoded mind or consciousness remains speculative.}
,{Whether older dogs receive social respect from younger dogs remains an empirical question.}
