,{How to witness to a Quinn who is Jayce's age remains an unresolved interpersonal question.}
,{The meaning of the note about a judge appointed by a president being influenced by Pegasus remains ambiguous.}
,{The relationship intended by the note that one idea is disapproved by the immediately preceding idea remains ambiguous.}
